Package: fabriconnect
Title: Read Microsoft Fabric Lakehouse Tables via OneLake
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("AKU", "CDIO", email = "researchers@aku.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions to connect to Microsoft Fabric Lakehouses
    via the OneLake HTTPS API, bypassing the TDS/IP firewall bug.
    Uses AzureStor for authentication and arrow for parquet reading.
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports: arrow, utils, DBI, httr, jsonlite
Suggests: duckdb, dplyr
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
